OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FContinuing
OL,6,Frather cloudy with patchy drizzle, but
OL,7,Fthere will be some clearer spells
OL,8,Faround, especially in the west where
OL,9,Fpatchy fog and perhaps a touch of
OL,10,Ffrost may develop.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FStill quite a lot of cloud
OL,13,Faround, with patchy rain possible
OL,14,Facross Lochaber and Caithness. Best of
OL,15,Fany bright spells again in the west.
OL,16,FLight winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
