OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FLittle
OL,6,Fchange, often cloudy through into next
OL,7,Fweek, with patchy drizzle or showers
OL,8,Fin north and east. Where any cloud
OL,9,Fbreaks occur, overnight fog and frost
OL,10,Fmay develop.
